<title>UK: Copper off highs, zinc hits new peak in LME PM.</title>
<headline>Copper off highs, zinc hits new peak in LME PM.</headline>
<text>
<p>COPPER - Settles back from nine-month highs, but still firm while backwardations also being maintained.</p>
<p>ZINC - Extends midsession advance, and hits new 4-1/2 year peak.</p>
<p>NICKEL - Drops back from highs, still steadier.</p>
<p>ALUMINIUM - Sags back after stalling above $1,690.</p>
<p>LEAD - Higher. TIN - Steadier. ALLOY - Quiet.</p>
</text>
